DTSTART:20261007T190000
DTEND:20261007T210000
DTSTAMP:20261007T175136Z
UID:69299f8c4262350bb6ac20f376e5b3@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Grand Kyiv Ballet presents The Swan Lake: Symphony of Lights\,
  a reimagining of Tchaikovsky’s classic that combines traditional choreo
 graphy and an international cast of dancers with vivid light design and il
 luminated costumes. The performance takes place for one night at Spruce Pe
 ak Arts in Stowe.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Spruce Peak Arts\, 122 Hourglass Dr.
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/the-swan-l
 ake-symphony-of-lights-13-08-2026-18-27-12
