BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wish Benefit Tour 2026 with Oteil Burbridge & LaMP
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261007
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261008
DTSTAMP:20261007T175136Z
UID:7cfcee8aeb463cd84a9f498e87ad24@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:For the first time ever\, Grammy Award-winning bassist Oteil B
 urbridge takes the stage with Vermont-based groove trio LaMP for a night o
 f jam-rooted\, improvisational rock — a one-night-only pairing you won't
  see anywhere else\, presented by Fiddlehead Brewing Company. Burbridge is
  a founding member of Dead & Company and a celebrated veteran of the Allma
 n Brothers Band and Aquarium Rescue Unit\; LaMP (Russ Lawton\, Scott Metzg
 er\, Ray Paczkowski) is known for their work with Trey Anastasio Band and 
 Joe Russo's Almost Dead. Come experience the kind of spontaneous\, in-the-
 moment playing these musicians are known for\, live at Higher Ground on We
 dnesday\, October 7\, 2026. Proceeds support Make-A-Wish\, helping grant w
 ishes for children facing critical illness across the Northeast. Tickets a
 vailable at www.wishbenefit.org. Artist Group Info abullock1289@gmail.com 
 1214 Williston Rd South Burlington \, Vermont 05403 https://highergroundmu
